# 11d -- the help, and folds that stay folded.
##
#   ./bin/hms --db-path=hms.db --render docs/review/11d-help.keys --width 92 --height 34
##
# A blank comment line is `##`, not `#`. A bare hash is the count KEY.

2: the locations tree
ctrl+n: onto the Garage
tab: the Garage, shut
ctrl+n: onto the Kitchen
ctrl+f: into it
tab: the Spice Cabinet, shut too
v: contents -- neither one springs open, and the rest show what they hold
1: the categories tree, folded independently
2: back, and the Locations folds are still here
alt+x
h
e
l
p
enter: every key and every command
esc: back where you were
